            "detailed_description": "Majestic-12 is a 3d action side-scroller where you take control of an elite MJ-12 commando and battle your way through secret installations and strange alien environments with your friends, or as a solo-operative. Mj12 has a retro vibe mixed with an exciting visual style and original game mechanics that will leave the player very satisfied. The game mixes humorous enemies with action-packed gameplay in single player, and several innovative multiplayer modes.<br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><br>•\tEasy to pick up, hard to master.<br>•\tLocal Multi-player.<br>•\t40 in-game Achievements<br>•\tExciting combat and movement mechanics seldom explored in side-scrollers<br>•\tEnjoyable arcade style campaign mode <br>•\tLocal co-op modes for 4 players<br>•\tLocal Multi-player modes for 4 players<br>•\tSurvival mode for 4 players<br>•\tVersus Combat mode for 4 players<br>•\tDrop-in / Drop-out multi-player<br>•\t3d playfield / depth - effects gameplay<br>•\tSpaceship combat side-scroller levels",
